<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING BUNDESLIGA GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING BUNDESLIGA GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in German first</p>
<p>division after Saturday's games:</p>
<p>9 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>8 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen)</p>
<p>7 - Bruno Labbadia (Werder Bremen), Ulf Kirsten (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler</p>
<p>(1860 Munich), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock), Fredi Bobic</p>
<p>(VfB Stuttgart), Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>6 - Harry Decheiver (SC Freiburg)</p>
